    "zh": "按一次事故的脉络读：采集事实（证据 / 运行时采样 / 注入现场时间线）→ 判定是不是崩了、崩在哪 → 记住它（或者后来跑通了就把记忆撤掉）→ 把现场打包给人看 → 继续盯守，好让下一次也被抓到。",
    "en": "Follow one incident: collect the facts (evidence, runtime sampling, injection timeline), judge whether it was a crash and why, remember it (or withdraw the memory when a later run succeeds), package the scene for a human, and keep watching so the next one is captured too."
